 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? Sandwiches, wraps, and salads in container work well. Add a few snacks for when you get hungry. It is, but the flavor does weaken. Keep it in a warm bag next to the fire. The classics like warm bread and cheese toast never let you down. bottle of hot tea or coffee keeps everyone warm and energized. A bowl of chocolate pudding or a fruit pie is nice at the end. Plan for about an hour per person for a simple picnic. Add more for sitting around.",
